B.a5N=new A.cY("Chat","At the top is You: a chat with yourself, kept in your own Google Drive. Below it are your groups, and All files, which lists every file from your groups.",!1)
B.a62=new A.cY("Send","Pick a file or write a note, pick where it goes, then pick how it opens: One open, Watermarked or Traceable copies.",!1)
B.a5R=new A.cY("What needs an account","Nothing, to send a note or file that opens once, or to open a link or code. Your own chat and groups need you to sign in with Google.",!1)
B.a5L=new A.cY("Everything else","Your picture at the top opens your account. Settings has Activity, notifications and Help.",!1)
B.acx=s([B.a5N,B.a62,B.a5R,B.a5L],t.eH)
B.ahO=s(["about","overview","start","what is this","purpose","tabs","navigation","where"],t.s)
B.a6t=new A.j2("what-is-no-sus","What NO SUS is","Two tabs. Chat is everything you keep. Send is everything you give away.",B.Co,B.acx,B.ahO)
B.a5W=new A.cY("Where it lives","In a NO SUS folder in your own Google Drive. NO SUS can open only the files it creates there, so connecting does not let it see the rest of your Drive.",!1)
B.a5O=new A.cY("Adding to it","Open Chat, then You. Type a note or attach a file. You can also share something to NO SUS from another app: it opens Send with You already picked.",!1)
B.a6b=new A.cY("Before Drive is connected","What you add waits on this phone as Not saved yet, and is stored as soon as you connect.",!1)
B.ad4=s([B.a5W,B.a5O,B.a6b],t.eH)
B.akn=s(["saved","you","drive","google drive","notes to self","library","keep"],t.s)
B.a6s=new A.j2("no-sus-chat","NO SUS Chat","A chat with yourself for notes, links and files, kept in your own Google Drive.",B.CC,B.ad4,B.akn)
B.a5K=new A.cY("How","On the other screen, open nosus.foo/go. On your phone, open Chat, tap Open on any screen and scan the QR it shows. Match the number, then choose what that screen can open.",!1)
B.a6f=new A.cY("Your account stays on your phone","The other screen only gets the items you approve, and only while the session is open.",!1)
B.a6_=new A.cY("After the session","Ending the session stops that screen from opening anything else. Files you downloaded or printed there can stay on it, so use a screen you trust.",!0)
B.ah6=s([B.a5K,B.a6f,B.a6_],t.eH)
B.ajN=s(["go","computer","borrowed","laptop","qr","scan","print","desk"],t.s)
B.a6B=new A.j2("open-on-any-screen","Open on any screen","Open your own chat on a computer without signing in to Google there.",B.ld,B.ah6,B.ajN)
B.a5Y=new A.cY("What and where","Choose a file or write a note. Send it to You, to one of your groups, or to Anyone with a link. Anyone with a link needs no account to open it.",!1)
B.a5Q=new A.cY("How it opens","For a link, turn on one of: One open, Watermarked, or Traceable copies. Each one says what it does right under it.",!1)
B.a5E=new A.cY("Opening a link or code","Send \u2192 Open a link or code. Codes work once and expire.",!1)
B.a6k=new A.cY("Sending nearby","Sending between two phones on the same Wi-Fi was removed. Send a link instead.",!1)
B.aeK=s([B.a5Y,B.a5Q,B.a5E,B.a6k],t.eH)
B.aiJ=s(["share","send","link","share sheet","nearby","receive","address","drop"],t.s)
B.a6x=new A.j2("send","Send","One flow: what, where, how.",B.Cy,B.aeK,B.aiJ)
B.a6j=new A.cY("How it works","It is encrypted on your phone first. The key goes in the link, after the # sign, which browsers never send to a server. The first person to open the link gets it, and the stored copy is deleted.",!1)
B.a5T=new A.cY("Limits","Up to 10 files and 50 MB together in one link. A single file can also get a short code to type in. While that code is unused, a copy of the key is kept on our server for up to 20 minutes.",!1)
B.a67=new A.cY("It really is one open","If a chat app previews the link, that counts as the open. The person then sees that it was already opened, which tells you something got to it first.",!0)
B.af8=s([B.a6j,B.a5T,B.a67],t.eH)
B.agf=s(["burn","burn note","burn file","secret","self destruct","one time","password","anonymous","size limit"],t.s)
B.a6w=new A.j2("one-open","One open","A note or file that is gone after the first person opens it. No account needed on either end.",B.Cu,B.af8,B.agf)
B.uT=new A.b6(61170,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a5D=new A.cY("How it works","Watermarked links are made from a file in one of your groups, so Send adds the file to a group first. You set how long the link works and how many times it can be opened.",!1)
B.a66=new A.cY("What you see","Each link has a log of when it was opened. You can revoke it at any time.",!1)
B.a5B=new A.cY("In a browser","A browser cannot block screenshots. The name on every page is what points back to the reader.",!0)
B.aeu=s([B.a5D,B.a66,B.a5B],t.eH)
B.acD=s(["securesend","share link","access controls","expiry","view limit","revoke","analytics"],t.s)
B.a6z=new A.j2("watermarked","Watermarked","A link to one file that shows the reader\u2019s name on every page. You can revoke it.",B.uT,B.aeu,B.acD)
B.a7p=new A.b6(63330,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a5X=new A.cY("How it works","NO SUS makes one copy per reader, each with tiny wording changes that read the same. The note needs enough lines for the changes to fit; if it is too short, add a few more.",!1)
B.a5G=new A.cY("If it leaks","Paste the leaked text into the leak check on your note. It tells you which copy it came from.",!1)
B.a5Z=new A.cY("Notes only for now",u.fD,!1)
B.a69=new A.cY("What it can\u2019t catch","Someone who rewrites the text in their own words can remove the changes.",!0)
B.ai3=s([B.a5X,B.a5G,B.a5Z,B.a69],t.eH)
B.akj=s(["canary","leak","trace","fingerprint","copies","who leaked"],t.s)
B.a6v=new A.j2("traceable-copies","Traceable copies","Each person gets a slightly different copy of a note. If it leaks, you\u2019ll know whose.",B.a7p,B.ai3,B.akj)
B.a76=new A.b6(61657,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a6a=new A.cY("Joining","Chat \u2192 Join with a link, then paste the invite link or code. You see the group name and how many members it has before you join. There is no list of groups to browse.",!1)
B.a5M=new A.cY("Starting one","Chat \u2192 New group. You become its admin. You can turn on an 8-character invite code, or invite people only with links you make.",!1)
B.a5U=new A.cY("Leaving","Open the group \u2192 Group options (top right) \u2192 Leave group. Anything you added stays with the group.",!1)
B.ang=s([B.a6a,B.a5M,B.a5U],t.eH)
B.alQ=s(["community","join","invite","create group","leave","new group"],t.s)
B.a6q=new A.j2("groups","Groups","A group chat for files, with its own members and activity. You join by invite.",B.a76,B.ang,B.alQ)
B.a6h=new A.cY("Members can","Read every file in the group, add their own, rename and delete what they added, and see the group\u2019s activity.",!1)
B.a65=new A.cY("Admins can also","Promote and demote members, remove and ban people, delete any file, manage invite links, and delete the group.",!1)
B.a6l=new A.cY("How it is enforced","By the database, not the app. The check runs on the server on every change, so an edited app gets a refusal, not a shortcut.",!1)
B.alx=s([B.a6h,B.a65,B.a6l],t.eH)
B.agF=s(["admin","member","permission","promote","demote","remove","ban","moderation"],t.s)
B.a6C=new A.j2("roles","Roles and permissions","Groups have admins and members. Admins manage people and files; members read and add.",B.Cz,B.alx,B.agF)
B.a5C=new A.cY("Adding","Open a group \u2192 Add a group file, or Send a file to the group. Everyone in the group can read it.",!1)
B.a6i=new A.cY("Reading","Tap a file to open it in the protected viewer. Chat \u2192 All files lists every file from your groups.",!1)
B.a6m=new A.cY("Touch to reveal","The page stays blurred until you hold your finger on it, which stops the person behind you. Turn it off in Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security.",!1)
B.a6d=new A.cY("What this does not do","Group files are not end-to-end encrypted. They are stored on our server and access is checked by database rules. For that, send a One open link instead: it is encrypted on your phone.",!0)
B.akL=s([B.a5C,B.a6i,B.a6m,B.a6d],t.eH)
B.aeR=s(["file","upload","pdf","vault","all files","viewer","study desk"],t.s)
B.a6r=new A.j2("secure-documents","Files in groups","Files in a group open in the protected viewer, marked with the reader\u2019s name.",B.bL,B.akL,B.aeR)
B.a63=new A.cY("Watermarks","Your email and the time are drawn over every page you open. A photo of the screen carries them too, so a leaked page points back to who opened it.",!1)
B.a5y=new A.cY("Screenshot blocking is Android-only","On Android the app blocks screenshots and screen recording, and records the attempt. On the web and on iOS nothing can stop a screenshot. There, the watermark and the activity log protect you.",!0)
B.a5F=new A.cY("A camera always wins","No app can stop someone photographing their screen with another phone. These controls tell you who, after the fact.",!0)
B.afP=s([B.a63,B.a5y,B.a5F],t.eH)
B.akD=s(["watermark","screenshot","screen record","capture","leak"],t.s)
B.a6u=new A.j2("watermarking","Watermarks and screenshots","Open files carry your name on screen, and on Android screenshots are blocked.",B.uT,B.afP,B.akD)
B.a77=new A.b6(61697,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a5V=new A.cY("What is recorded","Joins and leaves, files added, renamed, deleted and opened, screenshot attempts, and admin actions. It records who and when, never what a file says.",!1)
B.a5P=new A.cY("Visible to everyone in the group","Members see what admins do as easily as admins see members. Nobody gets a private log.",!1)
B.a5z=new A.cY("Tamper evidence","Entries are chained, so removing or editing one breaks the chain. Nothing can be quietly taken back, including by admins.",!1)
B.am6=s([B.a5V,B.a5P,B.a5z],t.eH)
B.anm=s(["audit","log","activity","history","who opened","tamper","security alerts"],t.s)
