B.a6U=new A.b6(58519,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a6e=new A.cY("Signing in","New accounts use Google. If you made your account with email, GitHub or a phone number, tap Other ways to sign in.",!1)
B.a5A=new A.cY("What is stored","Your email, display name and avatar. Files you add to groups. Activity entries for things you did. Your own chat is kept in your Google Drive, not on our server.",!1)
B.a5J=new A.cY("Who can see your email","Members of your groups. Activity names people by email, which is what makes it useful.",!0)
B.a68=new A.cY("Deleting your account","Your picture \u2192 Settings \u2192 Danger zone \u2192 Delete account. It removes your profile, your group memberships, every file you added (in every group) and the activity records of what you did. It can\u2019t be undone. Your own chat stays in your Google Drive.",!1)
